{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The heart of the world is breaking apart\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last hope lies with you and your friend! Two brave characters embark on an adventure to restore the planet\u2019s core using their magnetic powers. But it won\u2019t be easy\u2026 because sometimes you\u2019ll stick together, sometimes you\u2019ll push each other away, and sometimes you\u2019ll stay completely neutral and move on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926970/extras/ea4cad6c134abea6bb5081bb4c723998.poster.avif?t=1757965847\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926970/extras/ea4cad6c134abea6bb5081bb4c723998.webm?t=1757965847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926970/extras/ea4cad6c134abea6bb5081bb4c723998.mp4?t=1757965847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Negative, positive, or neutral?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice changes your progress. Stick together at the wrong moment? Guaranteed hilarious fall! Push at the right time? Now that\u2019s skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926970/extras/cf87f993e1251b1cc66e4085574bdb56.poster.avif?t=1757965847\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926970/extras/cf87f993e1251b1cc66e4085574bdb56.webm?t=1757965847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926970/extras/cf87f993e1251b1cc66e4085574bdb56.mp4?t=1757965847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stick to magnets, overcome challenges!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From dangerous platforms to magnetic traps, every level brings a new trial. Use magnets wisely to overcome obstacles, clear the stages, and save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926970/extras/515fea1ff446b8546d56cb5f6cc62771.poster.avif?t=1757965847\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926970/extras/515fea1ff446b8546d56cb5f6cc62771.webm?t=1757965847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926970/extras/515fea1ff446b8546d56cb5f6cc62771.mp4?t=1757965847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two Game Modes \u2013 Two Different Thrills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy Mode</strong>: Progress safely with checkpoints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard Mode</strong>: No checkpoints! Make a mistake, and you\u2019ll have to start from the beginning. If you dare, try it\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926970/extras/1635190b7d4cbfb80a4be81d76c75cc9.poster.avif?t=1757965847\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926970/extras/1635190b7d4cbfb80a4be81d76c75cc9.webm?t=1757965847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.